  "notes": [
    "Native Foundation build_tracing text control; not interchangeable with the common full JSON workload.",
    "C++ volatile queues lack mmap process-crash recovery; these results are not a universal ranking.",
    "Queue bounds use different units and include separately reported backend transit storage.",
    "Managed kron SPSC uses its native spin idle policy; legacy Runtime benchmark explicitly sleeps. Row consumer_idle records the selected policy.",
    "Foundation tracing full JSON uses the public TracingMakeWriter with an event formatter; native_tracing uses unmodified build_tracing and its private optimized fmt writer."
